						<img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="Island Girl" width="40" height="40" class="avatar avatar-initials" loading="lazy">						<b class="fn"><a href="https://www.blogger.com/profile/02311337866284042891" class="url" rel="ugc external nofollow">Island Girl</a></b> <span class="says">sagt:</span>					</div><!-- .comment-author -->

					<div class="comment-metadata">
						<a href="https://experimenteausmeinerkueche.de/wurst-nudel-pfanne.html/#comment-1086"><time datetime="2014-10-15T07:22:11+02:00">15. Oktober 2014 um 07:22 Uhr</time></a>					</div><!-- .comment-metadata -->

									</footer><!-- .comment-meta -->

				<div class="comment-content">
					<p>Gestern habe ich Dein Rezept fuer Huehnchen mit Gnocchi gemacht. Leider hatte ich nicht alle Zutaten in der FeWo, aber lecker war es trotzdem!!!! Danke und LG Gudrun</p>
				</div><!-- .comment-content -->

				<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-1086" data-commentid="1086" data-postid="993" data-belowelement="div-comment-1086" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Auf Island Girl antworten" aria-label="Auf Island Girl antworten">Antworten</a></div>			</article><!-- .comment-body -->
		</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li id="comment-1090" class="comment even thread-even depth-1">
			<article id="div-comment-1090" class="comment-body">
				<footer class="comment-meta">
					<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="Tonkabohne" width="40" height="40" class="avatar avatar-initials" loading="lazy">						<b class="fn"><a href="https://www.blogger.com/profile/04654843288819347497" class="url" rel="ugc external nofollow">Tonkabohne</a></b> <span class="says">sagt:</span>					</div><!-- .comment-author -->

					<div class="comment-metadata">
						<a href="https://experimenteausmeinerkueche.de/wurst-nudel-pfanne.html/#comment-1090"><time datetime="2014-10-17T03:36:52+02:00">17. Oktober 2014 um 03:36 Uhr</time></a>					</div><!-- .comment-metadata -->

									</footer><!-- .comment-meta -->

				<div class="comment-content">
					<p>Liebe Yvonne,<br />Richtig gute Hausmannskost 🙂<br />Ich liebe dieses Gericht &#8230;<br />Herzliche Grüße,<br />Sabine</p>
				</div><!-- .comment-content -->

				<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-1090" data-commentid="1090" data-postid="993" data-belowelement="div-comment-1090" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Auf Tonkabohne antworten" aria-label="Auf Tonkabohne antworten">Antworten</a></div>			</article><!-- .comment-body -->
		</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li id="comment-1091" class="comment odd alt thread-odd thread-alt depth-1">
			<article id="div-comment-1091" class="comment-body">
				<footer class="comment-meta">
					<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="bastelnmalenkuchenbacken" width="40" height="40" class="avatar avatar-initials" loading="lazy">						<b class="fn"><a href="https://www.blogger.com/profile/03211819133574698404" class="url" rel="ugc external nofollow">bastelnmalenkuchenbacken</a></b> <span class="says">sagt:</span>					</div><!-- .comment-author -->

					<div class="comment-metadata">
						<a href="https://experimenteausmeinerkueche.de/wurst-nudel-pfanne.html/#comment-1091"><time datetime="2014-10-17T06:05:02+02:00">17. Oktober 2014 um 06:05 Uhr</time></a>					</div><!-- .comment-metadata -->

									</footer><!-- .comment-meta -->

				<div class="comment-content">
					<p>So geht es mir oft auch liebe Yvonne. Und da zur Zeit bei uns eine Magen-Darm Grippe wütet und die hälfte der Familie sowieso nix essen kann, muss ich trotzdem für die Hungrigen was kochen. Und da kommt dein Gericht jetzt grad richtig 🙂 <br />Hab eienen schönen Tag! Liebe Grüsse Nica</p>
				</div><!-- .comment-content -->

				<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-1091" data-commentid="1091" data-postid="993" data-belowelement="div-comment-1091" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Auf bastelnmalenkuchenbacken antworten" aria-label="Auf bastelnmalenkuchenbacken antworten">Antworten</a></div>			</article><!-- .comment-body -->
		</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li id="comment-1408" class="comment even thread-even depth-1">
			<article id="div-comment-1408" class="comment-body">
				<footer class="comment-meta">
					<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="Anonym" width="40" height="40" class="avatar avatar-initials" loading="lazy">						<b class="fn">Anonym</b> <span class="says">sagt:</span>					</div><!-- .comment-author -->

					<div class="comment-metadata">
						<a href="https://experimenteausmeinerkueche.de/wurst-nudel-pfanne.html/#comment-1408"><time datetime="2015-02-18T14:44:05+01:00">18. Februar 2015 um 14:44 Uhr</time></a>					</div><!-- .comment-metadata -->

									</footer><!-- .comment-meta -->

				<div class="comment-content">
					<p>Hab das Rezept gerade nachgekocht aber das Buttergemuese weggelassen. 🙂 Das, was noch da war, musste weg &#8211; gefrorene Prinzessbohnen und Paprika. Bin sehr zufrieden damit. Es macht unglaublich satt und reicht fuer uns beiden Personen im Haushalt zwei Tage. 🙂</p>
				</div><!-- .comment-content -->

				<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-1408" data-commentid="1408" data-postid="993" data-belowelement="div-comment-1408" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Auf Anonym antworten" aria-label="Auf Anonym antworten">Antworten</a></div>			</article><!-- .comment-body -->
		</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li id="comment-4657" class="pingback odd alt thread-odd thread-alt depth-1">
			<div class="comment-body">
				Pingback: Blitzschnelle Mie-Nudelpfanne - Experimente aus meiner Küche 			</div>
		</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		</ol>

		
	
	
